{"1203140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RaidTitans", "steam_appid": 1203140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>RaidTitans is a classic-style real-time strategy role-playing game where you hire various mercenaries, craft equipment, and battle a variety of monsters. The hero, who lost everything in a single moment, is exiled to a remote village, but his story has only just begun.<br>Join his journey to discover past truths, faith, forgiveness, and love</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/0adcd017e476ae34655868d4403546b0.poster.avif?t=1788153774\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/0adcd017e476ae34655868d4403546b0.webm?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/0adcd017e476ae34655868d4403546b0.mp4?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Troops that grow with reputation</li></ul>As your reputation grows, you can hire up to 30 mercenaries. Make a free strategy!<br>The mercenaries are divided into five types : Attacker, Tank, Archer, Wizard and Healer<br>Different types have different skills and different characteristics, but it's up to you to choose<br>The more you build your reputation, the newer mercenaries will come to your tavern!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Emotional Story</li></ul>What happened when the world became peaceful? Follow the journey of the fallen hero<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/14246d7098fbd06e003129868d1861a6.poster.avif?t=1788153774\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/14246d7098fbd06e003129868d1861a6.webm?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/14246d7098fbd06e003129868d1861a6.mp4?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/1764d969483b5a645f8ccb7a46172141.poster.avif?t=1788153774\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/1764d969483b5a645f8ccb7a46172141.webm?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203140/extras/1764d969483b5a645f8ccb7a46172141.mp4?t=1788153774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Real-Time Combat</li></ul>Monsters are as smart and aggressive as players!<br>When the battle begins, command quickly and defeat the monster quickly before dark!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Materials Farming and Equipment Manufacturing</li></ul>We can defeat monsters, we can destroy boxes, barrels, certain rocks in battle areas, and we can get materials<br>Make better equipment using the materials you have acquired. It will be easier to fight!", "about_the_game": "<strong>RaidTitans is a classic-style real-time strategy role-playing game where you hire various mercenaries, craft equipment, and battle a variety of monsters. The hero, who lost everything in a single moment, is exiled to a remote village, but his story has only just begun.<br>Join his journey to discover past truths, faith, forgiveness, and love</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo